      "claim_text": "For multi-step sequential tool use within one turn, every accumulated thought signature must be preserved in history.",
      "claim_status": "asserted"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "c2",
      "claim_text": "In streaming, a thought signature may arrive in a final chunk with empty text, so stream parsers must check empty-text chunks for signatures.",
      "claim_status": "asserted"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "c3",
      "claim_text": "For parallel function calls, only the first functionCall part contains the signature and the parts must be returned in the exact order received.",
      "claim_status": "asserted"
    },
